>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must be a valid tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= v_1 ≠ null
>>
Rule 3 (input and exponent tensors must have compatible shapes for element-wise operation)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 4 (input and exponent tensors must have same number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
